# Used only when building the provian-website Docker image from repo root:
#   docker build -f provian-website/Dockerfile -t provian-website .
# The other Dockerfiles in this repo (provian-backend, provian-ops) use their own
# subdirectory as build context and carry their own .dockerignore files; this
# file does not affect them.

# Exclude everything from the build context by default.
*

# Re-include only what the website build needs. NB: OPEN_ITEMS.md (the internal
# tracker) is deliberately NOT re-included — it must never enter the build
# context. The /internal dashboard + its gen-open-items pipeline were removed
# 2026-07-06 (OPEN_ITEMS.md finding #3); nothing in the site build reads it.
!provian-website
!provian-website/**

# Then re-exclude heavy / sensitive paths inside the website dir.
provian-website/node_modules
provian-website/.next
provian-website/out
provian-website/.firebase
provian-website/.DS_Store
provian-website/*.pem
provian-website/npm-debug.log*
provian-website/.env*.local

# Never package local Android release artifacts in the website image.
provian-website/public/**/*.apk
